<body>
  <div class="preview-banner" role="status">AOV MEMBER SERVICE · LIVE HOST REVIEW · CHAT SETUP IN PROGRESS · <a href="https://github.com/mattbullis1/america-on-vibe/issues/new?template=bug_report.yml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">REPORT A BUG ↗</a></div>

  <aside id="site-notice" class="site-notice classic-window" aria-labelledby="site-notice-title">
    <div class="titlebar"><strong id="site-notice-title">✦ A note from AOV</strong></div>
    <div class="site-notice-body">
      <p>AOV is an independent, noncommercial nostalgia project inspired by the 1990s. We are preparing its code for an open-source release and are not affiliated with AOL.</p>
      <p>A session cookie keeps you signed in. This browser also saves your sound settings and this notice choice. External links lead to sites with their own policies.</p>
      <p>Surf responsibly: be kind in chat and keep personal information private.</p>
      <button id="site-notice-dismiss" class="classic-button primary" type="button">Got it</button>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main id="entry" class="entry-screen">
    <section class="entry-window classic-window" aria-labelledby="entry-heading">
      <div class="titlebar"><strong><span class="title-icon">✦</span> AOV Sign On</strong><span class="title-actions"><button type="button" aria-label="Close sign-on window" disabled>×</button></span></div>
      <div class="entry-body">
        <div class="approved-logo" role="img" aria-label="AOV America OnVibe logo: blue AOV letters, globe, golden orbit and star"></div>
        <h1 id="entry-heading">Welcome to AOV</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Your place on the internet, just like you remember.</p>
        <label class="checkbox-label entry-sound"><input id="entry-sound" type="checkbox" checked> Play connection sound</label>
        <div class="entry-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Account screens">
          <button id="login-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="login-form">Sign On</button>
          <button id="register-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="register-form">New Member</button>
        </div>
        <form id="login-form" class="form-stack">
          <label for="screen-name">Screen Name</label>
          <input id="screen-name" name="screen-name" maxlength="24" required autocomplete="username">
          <label for="preview-password">Password</label>
          <input id="preview-password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password">
          <button id="forgot-link" class="text-link" type="button">Forgot password?</button><p id="login-message" class="form-note form-message" role="status"></p>
          <button class="classic-button primary" type="submit">Sign On</button>
        </form>
        <form id="register-form" class="form-stack" hidden>
          <label for="new-screen-name">Screen Name</label><input id="new-screen-name" maxlength="24" required autocomplete="username" pattern="[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]{2,23}" title="3–24 letters, numbers, or underscores; begin with a letter">
          <label for="new-email">Recovery email</label><input id="new-email" type="email" maxlength="249" required autocomplete="email">
          <label for="new-zip">US ZIP code for local news and weather</label><input id="new-zip" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{5}" minlength="5" maxlength="5" required autocomplete="postal-code" title="Five-digit US ZIP code">
          <label for="new-password">Password</label><input id="new-password" type="password" minlength="12" required autocomplete="new-password"><label for="new-password-confirm">Confirm password</label><input id="new-password-confirm" type="password" minlength="12" required autocomplete="new-password"><label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true" for="website">Website<input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input id="accept-terms" type="checkbox" required> I accept the <a href="terms.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">terms</a></label>
          <p class="form-note">Your recovery email is not verified. Use an address you control.</p><p id="recovery-setup-note" class="form-note">Password recovery is unavailable until SMTP is configured.</p><button class="classic-button primary" type="submit">Create Account</button><p id="register-message" class="form-note form-message" role="status"></p>
        </form>
        <form id="recovery-form" class="form-stack" hidden><label for="recovery-email">Recovery email</label><input id="recovery-email" type="email" required autocomplete="email"><button class="classic-button primary" type="submit">Send Recovery Link</button><button class="text-link" type="button" data-entry="login">Back to Sign On</button><p id="recovery-message" class="form-note form-message" role="status"></p></form>
        <form id="reset-form" class="form-stack" hidden><label for="reset-password">New password</label><input id="reset-password" type="password" minlength="12" required autocomplete="new-password"><label for="reset-confirm">Confirm password</label><input id="reset-confirm" type="password" minlength="12" required autocomplete="new-password"><button class="classic-button primary" type="submit">Change Password</button><p id="reset-message" class="form-note form-message" role="status"></p></form>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-footer">AOV is an independent nostalgia project.</div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <section id="connecting" class="connecting-screen" aria-label="Connection status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
    <div class="connection-window classic-window">
      <div class="titlebar"><strong>AOV · Connecting</strong></div>
      <div class="connection-art"><img class="connection-logo" src="assets/aov-logo.png" alt="AOV America OnVibe logo"><div class="connection-frames" aria-hidden="true"><span class="connection-frame"></span><span class="connection-frame"></span><span class="connection-frame"></span></div></div>
      <div class="connection-controls"><strong id="connection-status">Connecting…</strong><progress id="connection-progress" max="4" value="0"></progress><small id="connection-detail">Contacting AOV.</small></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="app" class="app-shell" hidden>
    <header class="app-chrome">
      <nav class="menubar" aria-label="Main menu"><button type="button" data-open="welcome">File</button><button type="button" data-open="browser">Internet</button><button type="button" data-open="chat">People</button><button type="button" data-open="channels">Channels</button><button type="button" data-open="settings">Settings</button><button type="button" data-open="help">Help</button><button id="sign-off" type="button">Sign Off</button></nav>
      <nav class="toolbar ribbon" aria-label="AOV services ribbon">
        <div class="ribbon-group ribbon-mail"><span class="ribbon-heading">Mail <span id="mail-unread-badge" aria-live="polite"></span></span><div class="ribbon-actions"><button type="button" data-open="mail"><span class="tool-icon">✉</span>Read</button><button type="button" id="mail-write-shortcut"><span class="tool-icon">✎</span>Write</button></div></div>
        <div class="ribbon-group ribbon-people"><span class="ribbon-heading">People <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></span><div class="ribbon-actions"><button type="button" data-open="buddies"><span class="tool-icon">♟</span>Buddies</button><button type="button" data-open="chat"><span class="tool-icon">☏</span>Chat</button></div></div>
        <div class="ribbon-group ribbon-services"><span class="ribbon-heading">AOV Services <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></span><div class="ribbon-actions"><button type="button" data-open="channels"><span class="tool-icon">▦</span>Channels</button><button type="button" data-open="browser"><span class="tool-icon">◉</span>Internet</button></div></div>
        <div class="ribbon-group ribbon-settings"><span class="ribbon-heading">Settings <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></span><div class="ribbon-actions"><button type="button" data-open="settings"><span class="tool-icon">⚙</span>Preferences</button></div></div>
        <div class="ribbon-group ribbon-favorites"><button type="button" class="ribbon-heading favorites-heading" data-open="favorites">Favorites <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button><div class="ribbon-actions"><button type="button" data-open="favorites"><span class="tool-icon">★</span>My Favorites</button><button type="button" data-open="welcome"><span class="tool-icon">⌂</span>Welcome</button><button type="button" data-open="help"><span class="tool-icon">?</span>Help</button></div></div>
        <span class="ribbon-badge" role="img" aria-label="AOV America OnVibe"></span>
      </nav>
      <div class="keyword-bar"><div class="keyword-navigation" aria-label="Browser controls"><button id="global-back" type="button" aria-label="Back">◀</button><button id="global-forward" type="button" aria-label="Forward">▶</button><button id="global-refresh" type="button" aria-label="Refresh">↻</button><button id="global-home" type="button" aria-label="Browser Home">⌂</button><button id="global-bookmark" type="button" aria-label="Bookmark site">☆</button></div><label for="global-address">Keyword or Web Address</label><div class="keyword-entry"><input id="global-address" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-controls="keyword-suggestions" aria-expanded="false" placeholder="Type a keyword or web address"><div id="keyword-suggestions" class="keyword-suggestions" role="listbox" aria-label="AOV keyword matches" hidden></div></div><button id="global-go" class="classic-button" type="button">Go</button></div>
    </header>

    <main id="desktop" class="desktop" aria-label="AOV desktop">
      <section id="window-welcome" class="desktop-window classic-window" data-window="welcome" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
        <div class="titlebar drag-handle"><strong id="welcome-title">⌂ Welcome to AOV</strong><span class="title-actions"><button type="button" data-minimize="welcome" aria-label="Minimize Welcome">_</button><button type="button" data-maximize="welcome" aria-label="Maximize Welcome">□</button><button type="button" data-close="welcome" aria-label="Close Welcome">×</button></span></div>
        <div class="window-content welcome-content">
          <div class="welcome-layout">
            <nav class="welcome-services" aria-label="AOV services"><img src="assets/aov-logo.png" alt="AOV America OnVibe"><button type="button" data-open="welcome"><span class="service-icon">⌂</span><span>Welcome</span></button><button type="button" data-open="mail"><span class="service-icon">✉</span><span>Mail</span></button><button type="button" data-open="chat"><span class="service-icon">☏</span><span>Chat Rooms</span></button><button type="button" data-open="buddies"><span class="service-icon">♟</span><span>Buddy List</span></button><button type="button" data-open="channels"><span class="service-icon">▦</span><span>Channels</span></button><button type="button" data-open="browser"><span class="service-icon">◉</span><span>Internet</span></button></nav>
            <div class="welcome-main">
              <div class="welcome-heading"><h1>Welcome to AOV</h1><span>Your online world</span></div>
              <div class="welcome-feature-row">
                <section class="welcome-host" aria-label="AOV welcome"><img src="assets/welcome-host.jpg" alt="Middle-aged man smiling and welcoming everyone to AOV"><h2>Welcome, everyone!</h2><p>We're glad you're here. Make yourself at home. AOV is an independent nostalgia project and is not for commercial use.</p></section>
                <section class="welcome-news" aria-labelledby="news-title"><div class="news-heading"><h2 id="news-title">In the News</h2><span id="local-news-source">Local headlines</span></div><p id="local-weather" role="status">Loading local weather…</p><small>Weather: <a href="https://open-meteo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open-Meteo</a></small><ul id="news-headlines" aria-live="polite"><li>Loading local headlines…</li></ul><a id="more-local-news" href="https://news.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">More local news ↗</a></section>
              </div>
              <div class="welcome-bottom-strip"><strong>New on AOV:</strong> Explore channels, meet people, and revisit the web.</div>
            </div>
            <nav class="welcome-places" aria-label="My Places"><h2>My Places</h2><button type="button" data-open="mail">✉ Mail</button><button type="button" data-open="settings">▣ Preferences</button><button type="button" data-open="channels">▦ Channels</button><button type="button" data-open="browser">◉ Internet</button><button type="button" data-open="buddies">♟ People</button><button type="button" data-open="chat">☏ Chat Rooms</button><button type="button" data-open="help">? AOV Help</button></nav>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="window-mail" class="desktop-window classic-window" data-window="mail" aria-labelledby="mail-title" hidden>
        <div class="titlebar drag-handle"><strong id="mail-title">✉ AOV Mail</strong><span class="title-actions"><button type="button" data-minimize="mail" aria-label="Minimize Mail">_</button><button type="button" data-maximize="mail" aria-label="Maximize Mail">□</button><button type="button" data-close="mail" aria-label="Close Mail">×</button></span></div>
        <div class="window-content mail-content">
          <nav class="mail-nav" aria-label="Mail folders"><button id="mail-inbox" class="classic-button" type="button">Inbox</button><button id="mail-sent" class="classic-button" type="button">Sent</button><button id="mail-compose" class="classic-button" type="button">Write Mail</button><button id="mail-directory" class="classic-button" type="button">Members</button></nav>
          <div id="mail-list-view"><h2 id="mail-folder-title">Inbox</h2><div id="mail-list" class="mail-list"></div><div class="mail-pager"><button id="mail-prev" class="classic-button" type="button">Previous</button><span id="mail-page"></span><button id="mail-next" class="classic-button" type="button">Next</button></div></div>
          <article id="mail-read-view" hidden><div class="mail-actions"><button id="mail-back" class="classic-button" type="button">Back</button><button id="mail-reply" class="classic-button" type="button">Reply</button><button id="mail-archive" class="classic-button" type="button">Archive</button><button id="mail-report" class="classic-button" type="button">Report</button></div><h2 id="mail-read-subject"></h2><p id="mail-read-meta"></p><pre id="mail-read-body"></pre></article>
          <form id="mail-compose-view" hidden><h2>Write AOV Mail</h2><label for="mail-to">To screen name</label><input id="mail-to" maxlength="24" required autocomplete="off"><label for="mail-subject">Subject</label><input id="mail-subject" maxlength="120" required><label for="mail-body">Message</label><textarea id="mail-body" maxlength="10000" required rows="10"></textarea><button class="classic-button primary" type="submit">Send Mail</button><button id="mail-cancel" class="classic-button" type="button">Cancel</button></form>
          <div id="mail-directory-view" hidden><h2>Member Directory</h2><label for="mail-search">Search screen names</label><input id="mail-search" maxlength="24" autocomplete="off"><div id="mail-members" class="mail-list"></div></div>
          <div id="mail-status" class="statusbar" role="status">AOV Mail stays inside this service.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="window-browser" class="desktop-window classic-window" data-window="browser" aria-labelledby="browser-title" hidden>
        <div class="titlebar drag-handle"><strong id="browser-title">◉ AOV Internet</strong><span class="title-actions"><button type="button" data-minimize="browser" aria-label="Minimize Internet">_</button><button type="button" data-maximize="browser" aria-label="Maximize Internet">□</button><button type="button" data-close="browser" aria-label="Close Internet">×</button></span></div>
         <div class="window-content">
          <div id="browser-home-page" class="browser-page"><div class="browser-home-art"><span class="mini-logo" role="img" aria-label="AOV logo"></span><h2>Explore the web</h2><p>Type a website above to visit its closest available capture from 30 years ago, or choose a live destination below.</p></div><div class="browser-links"><button type="button" data-url="https://www.npr.org/sections/news/">NPR News</button><button type="button" data-url="https://www.npr.org/sections/sports/">NPR Sports</button><button type="button" data-url="https://www.wikipedia.org/">Wikipedia ↗</button><button type="button" data-url="https://archive.org/">Internet Archive ↗</button></div><div class="browser-callout"><strong>About websites in AOV</strong><p>Typed addresses open in the Wayback Machine when a capture is available. Channel buttons and the shortcuts above still open their current websites. Some sites cannot be displayed inside AOV.</p></div><div class="browser-bookmarks"><strong>Bookmarks</strong><span id="bookmark-list">No bookmarks saved.</span></div><div class="browser-bookmarks"><strong>Recent history</strong><span id="history-list">No visits saved.</span><button id="clear-history" type="button" class="classic-button">Clear History</button></div></div><div id="browser-news" class="browser-page" hidden><h2>NPR News</h2><p>Top stories from NPR’s RSS feed. Choose a headline to open it in AOV and update the address bar.</p><ul id="browser-news-headlines" aria-live="polite"><li>Loading the latest headlines…</li></ul><a href="https://www.npr.org/sections/news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit NPR’s full news site ↗</a></div><div id="browser-embedded" class="browser-embedded" hidden><div class="embedded-heading"><strong id="embedded-title">NPR</strong><a id="embedded-external" href="https://www.npr.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open on NPR ↗</a></div><iframe id="news-frame" title="NPR news in AOV browser"></iframe></div><div id="browser-external" class="browser-page" hidden><h2 id="external-title">External website</h2><p id="external-explanation">This site opens in a normal browser tab.</p><a id="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open website ↗</a></div><div id="browser-status" class="statusbar">AOV Home · Ready</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="window-chat" class="desktop-window classic-window" data-window="chat" aria-labelledby="chat-title" hidden>
        <div class="titlebar drag-handle"><strong id="chat-title">☏ AOV Chat</strong><span class="title-actions"><button type="button" data-minimize="chat" aria-label="Minimize Chat">_</button><button type="button" data-maximize="chat" aria-label="Maximize Chat">□</button><button type="button" data-close="chat" aria-label="Close Chat">×</button></span></div>
        <div class="window-content"><div class="chat-top"><label for="chat-room">Room:</label><select id="chat-room"><option value="0">Town Square</option><option value="1">Retro Computing</option><option value="2">Music Lounge</option></select><span><span id="online-count">0</span> online</span></div><form id="chat-invite-form" class="chat-compose" hidden><label for="chat-invite-name">Invite to your room</label><input id="chat-invite-name" maxlength="24" placeholder="Screen name" autocomplete="off"><button class="classic-button" type="submit">Invite</button></form><div class="chat-layout"><div id="chat-messages" class="chat-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite"><p class="chat-message system">Connecting to chat…</p></div><aside class="chat-users"><strong>People here</strong><div id="chat-online-users"></div></aside></div><form id="chat-form" class="chat-compose"><label for="chat-input" class="visually-hidden">Message</label><input id="chat-input" maxlength="500" placeholder="Type a message…" autocomplete="off"><button class="classic-button" type="submit">Send</button></form><div id="chat-admin" class="chat-admin" hidden><strong>Moderation</strong><form id="chat-ban-form" class="chat-compose"><label for="chat-ban-name" class="visually-hidden">Screen name</label><input id="chat-ban-name" maxlength="24" placeholder="Screen name"><label for="chat-ban-minutes" class="visually-hidden">Minutes</label><input id="chat-ban-minutes" type="number" min="1" max="1440" value="30"><button class="classic-button" type="submit">Ban</button><button id="chat-unban" class="classic-button" type="button">Unban</button></form><button id="chat-reports-refresh" class="classic-button" type="button">Review reports</button><div id="chat-reports"></div><form id="chat-filter-form" class="chat-compose"><label for="chat-filter-term">Blocked phrase</label><input id="chat-filter-term" maxlength="40" required><button class="classic-button" type="submit">Add filter</button></form><div id="chat-filter-list" aria-label="Blocked phrases"></div><div id="chat-guard-events" aria-label="Recent filtered messages"></div><form id="chat-unmute-form" class="chat-compose"><label for="chat-unmute-name">Clear automatic mute</label><input id="chat-unmute-name" maxlength="24" required placeholder="Screen name"><button class="classic-button" type="submit">Unmute</button></form></div><div id="chat-status" class="statusbar" role="status">Chat uses your AOV account.</div></div>
